      q: "<div class=\"stimulus\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 330 230\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:330px;height:auto\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\"><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"195\" x2=\"308\" y2=\"195\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><polygon points=\"315,195 308,198 308,192\" fill=\"#222\" stroke=\"none\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"195\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"42\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><polygon points=\"40,35 43,42 37,42\" fill=\"#222\" stroke=\"none\"/><text x=\"172.5\" y=\"225\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"normal\" fill=\"#222\">strain ε</text><text x=\"46\" y=\"31\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"normal\" fill=\"#222\">stress σ</text><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"195\" x2=\"66.5\" y2=\"112.5\" stroke=\"#c0392b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><path d=\"M66.5 112.5 C68.3 110.8 72.7 104.8 77.1 102 C81.5 99.2 89.5 96.5 93 96 C96.5 95.5 93.9 101 98.3 99 C102.7 97 109.3 90 119.5 84 C129.7 78 145.1 68.2 159.2 63 C173.4 57.8 191.5 53 204.3 52.5 C217.1 52 227.3 55.8 236.1 60 C244.9 64.2 253.8 75 257.3 78\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c0392b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"66.5\" cy=\"112.5\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#222\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"77.1\" cy=\"102\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#222\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"93\" cy=\"96\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#222\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"204.3\" cy=\"52.5\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#222\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"257.3\" cy=\"78\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#222\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"54.5\" y=\"110.5\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"normal\" fill=\"#222\">A</text><text x=\"67.1\" y=\"98\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"normal\" fill=\"#222\">B</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"90\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"normal\" fill=\"#222\">C</text><text x=\"204.3\" y=\"47.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"normal\" fill=\"#222\">D</text><text x=\"265.3\" y=\"84\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"normal\" fill=\"#222\">E</text><text x=\"40\" y=\"209\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"normal\" fill=\"#222\">O</text></svg><br>The graph (not to scale) shows how the stress in a metal wire changes with strain when the wire is stretched until it breaks. The wire obeys Hooke's law from O to A, where the stress is 240 MPa and the strain is 1.2×10⁻³. B is the elastic limit, C the yield point, D the maximum stress reached and E the breaking point.</div>Which point on the graph corresponds to the ultimate tensile stress?",
